  "name": "Logistics | 2 - Mock TMS API",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mock TMS API\nStands in for the real TMS during the demo.\n\n`POST /webhook/tms/orders`\n```json\n{ \"externalRef\": \"<opportunity id>\",\n  \"customerName\": \"...\",\n  \"route\": \"...\",\n  \"chargeableKg\": 999,\n  \"priceEur\": 174.06 }\n```\n- **201** accepted + `orderNo`\n- **200** duplicate (same externalRef)\n- **422** validation error\n\nSheet tab `TMS_Orders` headers: orderNo, externalRef, customerName, route, chargeableKg, priceEur, receivedAt, status",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 400,
        "color": "5"
      },
      "id": "f5868971-03cc-4ee1-819b-79f5fe294785",
      "name": "Note: TMS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
